11. Corrective Action

The application will be enhanced to handle PDF processing failures at the document level rather than only at the individual PDF operation level.

When an Aspose processing exception occurs for a PDF:

1. The affected PDF will be identified and marked as failed.
2. The failed PDF will not be passed to the subsequent PDF merge operation.
3. Processing of other valid PDFs in the EPIC ZIP will continue according to the existing partial-processing behavior.
4. Appropriate logging will be added to identify the affected PDF and processing stage.
5. Final PDF generation will only proceed with successfully processed documents.

